  "scripts/dev/Build-ItemStats.js": "Writes game/data/item-stats.json for the crafting comparison (#4558), a table that is not committed and that no server or other builder reads yet. It joins the chain as a step when that table is committed for the comparison to read.",
  "scripts/dev/Measure-HoldResources.py": "A measurement: counts where every harvestable plant and ore seam is placed by hold across npc-population.json's load order. Writes no table.",
  "scripts/dev/Measure-MineBuildings.py": "A measurement: reads doors.json and the load order and writes game/data/mine-buildings.json only when passed --out by hand, so Rebuild-ContentTables does not run it automatically.",
  "scripts/mods/Audit-ModMenus.js": "An audit: it says where each mod settings menu keeps its values and writes no table a server or another builder reads.",
  "scripts/mods/Audit-Mods.ps1": "An audit of the game folder's own install (its archives, folders and plugin list), which is what it is about. It reads no plugin's records.",
  "scripts/mods/Build-ContentOnBox.ps1": "Runs this whole chain itself, on the box (#5191, the gate's Build-Content verb): the plugin by Add-ContentRecords.py, then every step here by Run-OnBox.ps1, and keeps what they wrote by its inputs. It writes no table of its own."
 },
